{"name":"Focus","hex":"#e5e0d2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"focus","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A point at which reflected or refracted rays of light converge.","A point of a conic at which rays reflected from a curve or surface converge."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cause (rays of light, etc) to converge at a single point.","To adjust (a lens, an optical instrument) in order to position an image with respect to the focal plane."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/focus"}],"entries":[{"title":"Adelaide Fringe","blocks":[{"text":"Adelaide Fringe, formerly Adelaide Fringe Festival, is Australia's biggest arts festival and is the world's second-largest annual arts festival, held in the South Australian capital of Adelaide. Between mid-February and mid-March each year, it features more than 7,000 artists from around Australia and the world. Over 1,300 events are staged in hundreds of venues, which include work in a huge variety of performing and visual art forms. The Fringe features many free events occur alongside ticketed events for the duration of the festival."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Disco_Cuttlefish_at_Adelaide_Fringe_Festival_2014.JPG/330px-Disco_Cuttlefish_at_Adelaide_Fringe_Festival_2014.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adelaide_Fringe"},{"title":"Focus (2001 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Focus is a 2001 American drama film starring William H. Macy, Laura Dern, David Paymer and Meat Loaf based on a 1945 novel by playwright Arthur Miller. The film premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival and was given a limited release on October 19, 2001."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3a/Focus_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Focus_(2001_film)"},{"title":"Focus (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Focus is a Dutch progressive rock band formed in Amsterdam in 1969 by keyboardist, vocalist, and flautist Thijs van Leer, drummer Hans Cleuver, bassist Martijn Dresden, and guitarist Jan Akkerman. The band has undergone numerous formations in its history; since December 2016, it has comprised Van Leer, drummer Pierre van der Linden, guitarist Menno Gootjes, and bassist Udo Pannekeet. They have sold one million RIAA-certified albums in the United States."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Focus_live_at_The_Apex%2C_Bury_St_Edmunds_1st_May_2024_%2853694596356%29.jpg/330px-Focus_live_at_The_Apex%2C_Bury_St_Edmunds_1st_May_2024_%2853694596356%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Focus_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Gluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg/500px-Gluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Gluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg/1280px-Gluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Gluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg/500px-Gluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Gluttony at night, 2025 Adelaide Fringe","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGluttony_-_Adelaide_Fringe_2025_06.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Rundlemallfringe2019.jpg/500px-Rundlemallfringe2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Rundlemallfringe2019.jpg/1280px-Rundlemallfringe2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_c